      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "A zombie hulk can throw corpses at foes. While any Medium dead body will do, they sometimes throw Zombie Shamblers, who take just as much damage from being thrown as the target they hit. A thrown shambler lands Prone, but if it's not destroyed, it can rise and use other actions normally."
